[EXAMPLES]
Insert a new record into a file:

  recins -f Name -v "John Doe" -f Email -v "john@example.com" contacts.rec

Insert a record of a specific type:

  recins -t Task -f Title -v "Fix bug" -f Status -v Open todo.rec

Replace the record at position 3:

  recins -n 3 -f Name -v "Jane Doe" contacts.rec

